		<title>Fujifilm Has Over 40 New Lens Ideas: &#8216;It&#8217;s Difficult to Convey How Much We Care About Our Lenses&#8217;</title>
		<link>https://petapixel.com/2026/05/22/fujifilm-has-over-40-new-lens-ideas-its-difficult-to-convey-how-much-we-care-about-our-lenses/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jeremy Gray]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 18:21:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Interviews]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Podcast]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[focusonglass]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[fujifilm]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[fujifilmx]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[fujifilmxf]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[interview]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[lenses]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[petapixelpodcast]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[podcast]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[yujiigarashi]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://petapixel.com/?p=855941</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p class="feature-image"><a href="https://petapixel.com/2026/05/22/fujifilm-has-over-40-new-lens-ideas-its-difficult-to-convey-how-much-we-care-about-our-lenses/"><img width="1600" height="840" src="https://petapixel.com/assets/uploads/2026/05/Fujifilm-Has-Over-40-New-Lens-Ideas.jpg" class="attachment-card-large size-card-large wp-post-image" alt="A close-up view of multiple camera lenses arranged closely together, showing various reflections and details of the glass elements in each lens." decoding="async" /></a></p><p>This week on the PetaPixel Podcast, we sat down with Yuji Igarashi, General Manager of Professional Imaging Products in Fujifilm's Imaging Solutions Division. Echoing Fujifilm's successful Focus on Glass event in early March, we mostly chatted about glass, including where Igarashi thinks Fujifilm succeeds, and where it can go from here.</p>
